    "title": "Lamp Lighting Ceremony",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "One hundred and twenty nine nursing students from Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery Diploma in Nursing and BSc Nursing programmes participated in the 31st Lamp Lighting Ceremony.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "9903170e76a152dc",
